  "text": "Let's unpack this. We've got a fantastic deep dive today, and it's centered on a tool called AI Media Cutter. It's an open source project that's [UH] really trying to redefine video editing using AI. So our mission is to figure out how this thing, this desktop app, uses large language models to turn what is a really complex visual task into something you just do with text. It's a huge shift. We're talking about using LLMs, you know, like Google Gemini or the Open AI models, to edit based on meaning, on the actual content. Exactly. It moves editing from this highly technical frame-by-frame skill to something that's more [UH] editorial. It's all about the story and the text. Right. It starts with a very high accuracy AI transcription.",
